{
  "protocol": "arkism-sys06-flag-matrix-v1",
  "default_mode": "off",
  "unknown_mode": "startup_error",
  "modes": [
    "off",
    "shadow",
    "dynamic",
    "emergency_fallback"
  ],
  "conditions": [
    "normal",
    "stale_state",
    "corrupt_state",
    "timeout",
    "nan_score",
    "version_error",
    "delete_race",
    "correction_race"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "off keeps the current baseline result, budget, permissions and use receipts.",
    "shadow returns the baseline and adds no delivery, receipt or reinforcement side effect; diagnostics stay separate.",
    "dynamic runs verified candidates, the fixed policy, packing and the final fence in that order.",
    "A policy fault falls back to the baseline with a recorded reason and count, after rechecking the current canonical state (scope, approval, source, deletion, revision).",
    "delete_race and correction_race never revive deleted or superseded memories; they are excluded by the final fence in every mode.",
    "No rollback restores an older snapshot over a newer deletion or correction boundary."
  ],
